{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026iXuzsF3oZq1793088143.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>立法會議員本月起加薪近百分之1.6，每月酬金逾11萬元。</p><p></p><p>立法會秘書處上載最新議員酬津安排，議員基本月薪加1,740元，至逾11萬元。立法會主席月薪為議員的雙倍，加3,480元至逾22萬元。</p><p></p><p>另外議員每年的醫療津貼亦加約百分之1.6，至約3.8萬元，用於發還實際的醫療及牙科開支、個人醫療及牙科保險等。秘書處指，相關酬金及醫療津貼是根據丙類消費物價指數的變動幅度，在每年10月調整。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T09:22:16.429770+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T07:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T13:18:32.793271+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:18:27.242825+00:00","content_hash":"c6c91b775f56405cb5de670253692a4a1c085ca8d2184573bc21e30988238588","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}